  "description": "Immerse yourself in the world of glamour and timeless beauty with Noctelle Rouge. This extraordinary high-contrast display serif is known for its expressive strokes and masterfully moulded curves. Derived from the perennial charm of the classic Didone style and invoking hints of after-hours allure, Noctelle Rouge carves a niche for itself as a quietly dramatic addition to luxury logos, alluring beauty branding, and captivating editorial headlines.\nSo, what does Noctelle Rouge bring to the table? It serves as the ideal accompaniment to beauty, skincare, and perfume branding, adds a touch of elegance to luxury logos and monograms, and has the ability to breathe life into editorial headlines and magazine covers. Noctelle Rouge also accentuates the packaging of cosmetics, candles, wine, and boutique brands. It dresses up fashion lookbooks, stands out on wedding invitations, adorns book covers, and transforms posters & signage. \nWith Noctelle Rouge, transform any project into an emblem of elegance draped in the allure of the twilight. Start your journey with Noctelle Rouge today and indulge in the opulence it brings.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Immerse yourself in the world of glamour and timeless beauty with Noctelle Rouge. This extraordinary high-contrast display serif is known for its expressive strokes and masterfully moulded curves. Derived from the perennial charm of the classic Didone style and invoking hints of after-hours allure, Noctelle Rouge carves a niche for itself as a quietly dramatic addition to luxury logos, alluring beauty branding, and captivating editorial headlines.</p>\n<p>So, what does Noctelle Rouge bring to the table? It serves as the ideal accompaniment to beauty, skincare, and perfume branding, adds a touch of elegance to luxury logos and monograms, and has the ability to breathe life into editorial headlines and magazine covers. Noctelle Rouge also accentuates the packaging of cosmetics, candles, wine, and boutique brands. It dresses up fashion lookbooks, stands out on wedding invitations, adorns book covers, and transforms posters &amp; signage. </p>\n<p>With Noctelle Rouge, transform any project into an emblem of elegance draped in the allure of the twilight. Start your journey with Noctelle Rouge today and indulge in the opulence it brings.</p>",
